      "display_order": 1,
      "question_text": "The complex numbers $z$ and $w$ satisfy the equations $$z + (1 + \\mathrm{i})w = \\mathrm{i} \\quad \\text{and} \\quad (1 - \\mathrm{i})z + \\mathrm{i}w = 1.$$ Solve the equations for $z$ and $w$, giving your answers in the form $x + \\mathrm{i}y$, where $x$ and $y$ are real.",
